1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,100
Listen to an announcement in a classroom.

2
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:09,240
I want to remind you all that we will have a paper due every Friday.

3
00:00:09,240 --> 00:00:13,120
The paper should be a response to the week's reading

4
00:00:13,120 --> 00:00:16,049
and should be at least 2 pages long.

5
00:00:16,049 --> 00:00:21,250
Papers should be uploaded to the class portal on Fridays by 5 PM.

6
00:00:21,250 --> 00:00:26,160
I will grade them and send you feedback by the end of the weekend.

7
00:00:26,160 --> 00:00:32,316
Late papers will be marked down by one letter grade each day unless you speak

8
00:00:32,316 --> 00:00:36,010
with me ahead of time and receive an extension.
